From c7244b0633a8557f4910b07e216bb32561830a37 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?A=CC=82nderson=20Q?= <anquadros@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 7 Jun 2026 11:33:59 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] terminal: keep terminal content above the input editor
 overlay

The overlay was absolutely positioned, so the terminal's bottom rows
rendered underneath it. Lay the view out as a column where the terminal
takes the remaining space and the overlay reserves its own height, so the
grid reflows above it. Covered by a viewport-shrink regression test.
---
 crates/terminal_view/src/terminal_view.rs | 53 ++++++++++++++++++++---
